  "doc5GuidanceCarpenter": "Do not remove or modify load-bearing structures. Have uncertain structures assessed by a qualified professional. Check that installed items are secure, level and stable.",
  "doc5GuidancePainter": "Follow the paint and primer instructions. Use suitable protection when sanding or handling chemicals. Stop if lead paint, asbestos, severe moisture or an unsuitable substrate is suspected. Drying and curing time is not included; check the finished surface for runs and defects.",
