  "doc5GuidanceElectrician": "Never work on a live installation. If you cannot safely isolate and verify the circuit, or are unsure about wiring, earthing or circuit protection, stop and use a qualified electrician. Follow product instructions and applicable electrical standards; verify correct operation and earthing before use.",
